<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Karstadt.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Karstadt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it has issued five million European-style warrants on Karstadt AG.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    560 DEM		   PREMIUM	20.34 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     8.38 DEM		  GEARING	6.38 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	22.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS, STUTT    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  535 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
